---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
	<h1>Selam, I'm Myursel.</h1>

	<p class="lead">
		Third-year Artificial Intelligence student at Radboud University in Nijmegen, living in
		Arnhem. I grew up in Izmir and have lived and worked across Turkey, the Netherlands and
		Ireland before settling here.
	</p>

	<p>
		This site is where I keep track of what I build; course projects, side projects, and
		whatever I happen to be learning at the time. Less a polished portfolio, more a working
		notebook I am happy to leave open.
	</p>

	<h2>What I'm working on</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>PaperScroll</strong> : a Next.js reading feed for arXiv papers.</li>
		<li><strong>A local AI stack</strong> :running models on my own machine instead of someone else's.</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Home network</strong> : a Raspberry Pi doing DNS-level filtering, with an automation
			server as the next step.
		</li>
		<li><strong>University</strong> : BSc Artificial Intelligence. </li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		Start with <a href="/blog">the blog</a>, or read a bit more <a href="/about">about me</a>.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.lead {
		font-size: 1.15em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}
	ul {
		padding-left: 1.2em;
	}
	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
</style>